  data:
    Id: wardrune
    DisplayName: Wardrune
    Description: Unspent mana becomes a ward at the top of the wearer's own turn.
      Deliberately the WEAK affix of the old Runic family (see FightTuning.RunicWardConversionRate's
      own comment) -- a safety net for mana a caster was going to leave on the table
      anyway, not a build-around tank strategy. Runic's old bundle split four ways
      -- see Runic, Manaflow and Quickcast's own descriptions for the rest of the
      family.
    SortOrder: 23
    Effects:
    - Type: 14
      Magnitude: 0
      Threshold: 0
      AgainstType: 0
      HasAgainst: 0
      AgainstMagical: 0
